 @RajKumar-yn3yg  inka North pasanga work panna tha varanka na illanu sollala but 2 crore people venam.  rompa kasdam apdinu  irukuravan mattum varanum

  ninka sonna mathri other state karankaluku work permit kondu varanum

 nalla sampathuchona aduthe set pasanga varanum ipdi kootama south la irunthu 8 kodi perum North india pona North karan summa irupankala athuvu 7 pillainkala அம்மா அப்பா nu ellaru family oda varanka train la ticket edukrathu illa aprum yar ulla viduava
